# API Contracts: Todo AI Chatbot – MCP Server Tools

## Overview
This document defines the API contracts for the MCP tools that expose task operations.

## add_task Tool

### Description
Creates a new task for the authenticated user.

### Input Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "title": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Title of the task",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 255
    },
    "description": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Detailed description of the task",
      "maxLength": 1000
    }
  },
  "required": ["title"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Output Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "success": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "Indicates if the operation was successful"
    },
    "task_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID of the created task"
    },
    "message": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Human-readable message about the operation"
    }
  },
  "required": ["success", "task_id", "message"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Example Request
```json
{
  "title": "Buy groceries",
  "description": "Need to buy milk, bread, and eggs"
}
```

### Example Response
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "task_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "message": "Task 'Buy groceries' created successfully"
}
```

## list_tasks Tool

### Description
Returns all tasks for the authenticated user, with optional filtering.

### Input Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "status": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["pending", "completed", "all"],
      "default": "all",
      "description": "Filter tasks by status"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Output Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "success": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "Indicates if the operation was successful"
    },
    "tasks": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "UUID of the task"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Title of the task"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Description of the task"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["pending", "completed"],
            "description": "Current status of the task"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "Creation timestamp"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "Last update timestamp"
          }
        },
        "required": ["id", "title", "status", "created_at", "updated_at"],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    "count": {
      "type": "integer",
      "description": "Total number of tasks returned"
    },
    "message": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Human-readable message about the operation"
    }
  },
  "required": ["success", "tasks", "count", "message"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Example Request
```json
{
  "status": "pending"
}
```

### Example Response
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
      "title": "Buy groceries",
      "description": "Need to buy milk, bread, and eggs",
      "status": "pending",
      "created_at": "2023-01-01T10:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2023-01-01T10:00:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "count": 1,
  "message": "Retrieved 1 pending task(s)"
}
```

## complete_task Tool

### Description
Marks a specific task as completed for the authenticated user.

### Input Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "task_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID of the task to mark as completed"
    }
  },
  "required": ["task_id"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Output Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "success": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "Indicates if the operation was successful"
    },
    "task_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID of the completed task"
    },
    "message": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Human-readable message about the operation"
    }
  },
  "required": ["success", "task_id", "message"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Example Request
```json
{
  "task_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
}
```

### Example Response
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "task_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "message": "Task 'Buy groceries' marked as completed"
}
```

## update_task Tool

### Description
Updates the details of a specific task for the authenticated user.

### Input Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "task_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID of the task to update"
    },
    "title": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "New title of the task",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 255
    },
    "description": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "New description of the task",
      "maxLength": 1000
    },
    "status": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["pending", "completed"],
      "description": "New status of the task"
    }
  },
  "required": ["task_id"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Output Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "success": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "Indicates if the operation was successful"
    },
    "task_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID of the updated task"
    },
    "message": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Human-readable message about the operation"
    }
  },
  "required": ["success", "task_id", "message"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Example Request
```json
{
  "task_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "title": "Buy groceries and cook dinner",
  "status": "completed"
}
```

### Example Response
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "task_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "message": "Task 'Buy groceries and cook dinner' updated and marked as completed"
}
```

## delete_task Tool

### Description
Removes a specific task from the authenticated user's list.

### Input Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "task_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID of the task to delete"
    }
  },
  "required": ["task_id"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Output Schema (JSON Schema)
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "success": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "Indicates if the operation was successful"
    },
    "task_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID of the deleted task"
    },
    "message": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Human-readable message about the operation"
    }
  },
  "required": ["success", "task_id", "message"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Example Request
```json
{
  "task_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
}
```

### Example Response
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "task_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "message": "Task 'Buy groceries' deleted successfully"
}
```

## Error Response Schema

All tools follow this standard error response format:

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "success": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "const": false,
      "description": "Indicates the operation failed"
    },
    "error": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Human-readable error message"
    },
    "error_code": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Machine-readable error code"
    }
  },
  "required": ["success", "error", "error_code"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

### Example Error Response
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Task not found or access denied",
  "error_code": "TASK_NOT_FOUND"
}
```